  "description": "•\tInstallation of additional internal riser cupboards at Ground Floor, First Floor and Second Floor levels.\n•\tEach new riser cupboard will replicate the size, form, construction, finish and general appearance of the existing adjacent riser cupboard, so that the new work reads as a continuation of the established internal services arrangement.\n•\tFormation of limited floor penetrations for vertical service routes. The penetrations will replicate the arrangement and character of existing service penetrations and will be kept to the minimum dimensions necessary for the services.\n•\tFormation of limited wall penetrations for pipework. These will similarly follow existing service routes/details where practicable and will be no larger than required.\n•\tLocal making good around the new cupboards and penetrations to match the adjacent finishes.\n\nThe works are internal. No alteration to the principal external elevations, roof form, stair towers, cupolas or other external architectural features is proposed.\n",
